message: "If you use this artifact, please cite it as below."
title: "Conventions, Not Constants: A Reproducible Audit of Quantitative Claims in Practical Motor-Drive and Embedded-Systems Education"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Embedded Claims Audit Project"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-17"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/M0-AR/embedded-claims-audit"
url: "https://m0-ar.github.io/embedded-claims-audit/"
abstract: >-
  A claim-audit protocol and ten executable experiments that test widely taught
  quantitative rules in motor drives, embedded buses, and PCB design against
  closed-form mathematics, switching-level simulation, commercial datasheets,
  and a public PMSM measurement dataset.
keywords:
  - reproducibility
  - motor drives
  - BLDC
  - PMSM
  - SVPWM
  - dead time
  - embedded systems
  - PCB
